[en.FOCUS_C01_INDUSTRY_DEVELOPMENT]
Production is Magic!

[en.FOCUS_C01_INDUSTRY_DEVELOPMENT_desc]
The development of industry should start from the basics. The Empire should first conduct small-scale infrastructure construction experiments, and then promote them to the whole of Equestria after success.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_INDUSTRY_DEVELOPMENT]
产能是魔法！

[zh.FOCUS_C01_INDUSTRY_DEVELOPMENT_desc]
工业的发展，应该从基础开始。帝国应该先进行小幅度的基础设施建设试验，成功后再向全小马利亚进行大范围推广。

